            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "You'd need to define these autocommands before `require('mini.indentscope').setup()`.\r\nTry something like this:\r\n```lua\r\nvim.cmd([[\r\n  augroup InsertDisable\r\n    au!\r\n    au InsertEnter * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true\r\n    au InsertLeave * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = false\r\n  augroup END]]\r\n)\r\nrequire('mini.indentscope').setup()\r\n```",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">You'd need to define these autocommands before <code class=\"notranslate\">require('mini.indentscope').setup()</code>.<br>\nTry something like this:</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"vim.cmd([[\n  augroup InsertDisable\n    au!\n    au InsertEnter * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true\n    au InsertLeave * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = false\n  augroup END]]\n)\nrequire('mini.indentscope').setup()\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">cmd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">[[</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">  augroup InsertDisable</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    au!</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    au InsertEnter * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">    au InsertLeave * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = false</span>\n<span class=\"pl-s\">  augroup END<span class=\"pl-pds\">]]</span></span>\n)\n<span class=\"pl-c1\">require</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span>mini.indentscope<span class=\"pl-pds\">'</span></span>).<span class=\"pl-c1\">setup</span>()</pre></div>",
            "bodyText": "You'd need to define these autocommands before require('mini.indentscope').setup().\nTry something like this:\nvim.cmd([[\n  augroup InsertDisable\n    au!\n    au InsertEnter * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = true\n    au InsertLeave * lua vim.b.miniindentscope_disable = false\n  augroup END]]\n)\nrequire('mini.indentscope').setup()",
